{
  "schema_version": "acs-requirements/1",
  "requirements": [
    {
      "id": "R-001",
      "statement": "`sender` 来自可信 ingress context；正文、HTTP 参数、Session 标题均不授予身份。",
      "normative_doc": "docs/03_CORRECTNESS_CONTRACT.md",
      "work_package": "WP01",
      "test_ids": [
        "T001",
        "T002"
      ],
      "status": "not_implemented"
    },
    {
      "id": "R-002",
      "statement": "保留 Client/Root/Route/ordinary Slot 权限；未绑定不等于 Client；管理者不能默认读取私信。",
      "normative_doc": "docs/03_CORRECTNESS_CONTRACT.md",
      "work_package": "WP01",
      "test_ids": [
        "T003",
        "T004"
      ],
      "status": "not_implemented"
    },
    {
      "id": "R-003",
      "statement": "to 是稳定授权地址，Native 目标解析只在接收侧完成，默认无需发送方指定 Harness。",
      "normative_doc": "docs/03_CORRECTNESS_CONTRACT.md",
      "work_package": "WP01",
      "test_ids": [
        "T005",
        "T006"
      ],
      "status": "not_implemented"
    },
    {
      "id": "R-004",
      "statement": "消息提交、reply 索引、请求去重和 Outbox 同一事务；Authority ACK 只能在 commit 后发出。",
      "normative_doc": "docs/03_CORRECTNESS_CONTRACT.md",
      "work_package": "WP02",
      "test_ids": [
        "T007",
        "T008"
      ],
      "status": "not_implemented"
    },
    {
      "id": "R-005",
      "statement": "幂等键作用域 `(authority_incarnation, tenant, actor_address, operation_kind, client_request_id)`；规范化内容/目标/activation/reply_to/附件摘要不同则冲突；不同键同文是不同消息。",
      "normative_doc": "docs/03_CORRECTNESS_CONTRACT.md",
      "work_package": "WP02",
      "test_ids": [
        "T009",
        "T010"
      ],
      "status": "not_implemented"
    },
    {
      "id": "R-006",
      "statement": "reply_to 仅引用同一真实对端发给当前作者的请求；第三方委派使用新消息，不能代答。`sync` 与 wait 始终观察同一首个合法显式回复；澄清也是回复。",
      "normative_doc": "docs/03_CORRECTNESS_CONTRACT.md",
      "work_package": "WP02",
      "test_ids": [
        "T011",
        "T012"
      ],
      "status": "not_implemented"
    },
    {
      "id": "R-007",
      "statement": "Native 接纳、Provider 消费、Native turn 完成、消息在 UI 展示/阅读均不构成显式回复。",
      "normative_doc": "docs/03_CORRECTNESS_CONTRACT.md",
      "work_package": "WP02",
      "test_ids": [
        "T013",
        "T014"
      ],
      "status": "not_implemented"
    },
    {
      "id": "R-008",
      "statement": "message_only 不 Native 激活，包括与 sync 同时使用时。超时只停止 wait；消息、已触发操作和晚到回复保留。",
      "normative_doc": "docs/03_CORRECTNESS_CONTRACT.md",
      "work_package": "WP02",
      "test_ids": [
        "T015",
        "T016"
      ],
      "status": "not_implemented"
    },
    {
      "id": "R-009",
      "statement": "读取历史不消费。UTF-8 字节续读保留原 handle 与 next_offset（含 0）；原文和内嵌回复各自预算/游标。",
      "normative_doc": "docs/03_CORRECTNESS_CONTRACT.md",
      "work_package": "WP05",
      "test_ids": [
        "T017",
        "T018",
        "T094"
      ],
      "status": "not_implemented"
    },
    {
      "id": "R-010",
      "statement": "authority 接受顺序可用于消息/事件游标，但不是跨机器工作发生时间。",
      "normative_doc": "docs/03_CORRECTNESS_CONTRACT.md",
      "work_package": "WP05",
      "test_ids": [
        "T019",
        "T020"
      ],
      "status": "not_implemented"
    },
    {
      "id": "R-011",
      "statement": "每次 Native 可能副作用之前持久化 operation_id、message/delivery 引用、canonical hash、binding_epoch、provider_generation、权限校验依据。",
      "normative_doc": "docs/03_CORRECTNESS_CONTRACT.md",
      "work_package": "WP02",
      "test_ids": [
        "T021",
        "T022"
      ],
      "status": "not_implemented"
    },
    {
      "id": "R-012",
      "statement": "same operation 在 transport retry 使用同 ID；查询与 replay-safe retry 只能作用原 Native 实例/去重域。没有证据不能生成新 operation 来规避未知。",
      "normative_doc": "docs/03_CORRECTNESS_CONTRACT.md",
      "work_package": "WP02",
      "test_ids": [
        "T023",
        "T024"
      ],
      "status": "not_implemented"
    },
    {
      "id": "R-013",
      "statement": "超时/网络错误/进程退出后 outcome=unknown；reconcile 可返回 accepted/definitively_not_admitted/unknown。只有可验证未接纳或原生同去重域 replay-safe 才允许恢复发送。",
      "normative_doc": "docs/03_CORRECTNESS_CONTRACT.md",
      "work_package": "WP04",
      "test_ids": [
        "T025",
        "T026",
        "T096"
      ],
      "status": "not_implemented"
    },
    {
      "id": "R-014",
      "statement": "接收端原子检查当前 epoch/generation/operation authority；租约失效不足以阻止旧进程，必须有实际 receiver fence。无法 fence 的通路标低能力，未知时停住。",
      "normative_doc": "docs/03_CORRECTNESS_CONTRACT.md",
      "work_package": "WP02",
      "test_ids": [
        "T027",
        "T028"
      ],
      "status": "not_implemented"
    },
    {
      "id": "R-015",
      "statement": "准备前和原生 handoff 前重验授权与绑定；撤销在副作用之前阻止执行。已经发往 Provider 的输入不能承诺撤回，记录竞态事实。",
      "normative_doc": "docs/03_CORRECTNESS_CONTRACT.md",
      "work_package": "WP03",
      "test_ids": [
        "T029",
        "T030"
      ],
      "status": "not_implemented"
    },
    {
      "id": "R-016",
      "statement": "busy 允许安全原生排队或延迟；approval/question/user draft/paused 默认禁止自动穿透；只依据已证明能力和明确策略例外。",
      "normative_doc": "docs/03_CORRECTNESS_CONTRACT.md",
      "work_package": "WP03",
      "test_ids": [
        "T031",
        "T032"
      ],
      "status": "not_implemented"
    },
    {
      "id": "R-017",
      "statement": "unknown/stale observation 不是 idle；静默、标题、屏幕文字可作为推断，不能单独证明已消费或确定无副作用。",
      "normative_doc": "docs/03_CORRECTNESS_CONTRACT.md",
      "work_package": "WP01",
      "test_ids": [
        "T033",
        "T034"
      ],
      "status": "not_implemented"
